What are Rapid Prototyping Tools?
Rapid Prototyping Tools (RPTs) encompass both software and hardware solutions that enable designers and engineers to swiftly create functional models of products, applications, or systems prior to full-scale production. These tools range from digital platforms facilitating wireframing and interactive simulations to advanced physical fabrication technologies like 3D printing. The market includes both cloud-based and on-premises solutions serving industries from automotive to healthcare, consumer electronics to aerospace.
